---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Case Studies — Windrose & Company"
  description="Every Windrose engagement is documented so you can see exactly what was delivered and what the outcome was. No anonymized summaries."
>
  <Nav />

  <div style="background:#06101E;padding:100px 52px 80px;">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:32px;"><div style="width:28px;height:1px;background:#C4942A;"></div><span style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;color:#C4942A;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;">Case Studies</span></div>
    <h1 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:64px;font-weight:300;color:#F4EFE6;line-height:1.06;margin:0 0 20px;">Work that holds up<br>when it matters.</h1>
    <p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:300;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.5);line-height:1.82;margin:0;max-width:540px;">Every engagement is documented so you can see exactly what was delivered, and what the outcome was. No anonymized summaries.</p>
  </div>

  <article style="background:#0B1524;border-top:1px solid rgba(196,148,42,0.1);">
    <div style="padding:0 52px;">
      <div style="padding:52px 0 40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:48px;align-items:start;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(196,148,42,0.1);">
        <div>
          <div style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#C4942A;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px;">AI Safety Foundation &middot; Nov. 2025</div>
          <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:48px;font-weight:400;color:#F4EFE6;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.1;">Strain-Japan R-XVI<br>School District</h2>
          <p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.4);margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Rural K-8 &middot; Single school &middot; Franklin County, Missouri</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding-top:8px;">
          <div style="background:rgba(196,148,42,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(196,148,42,0.15);padding:20px;text-align:center;">
            <div style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:48px;font-weight:300;color:#C4942A;line-height:1;">0</div>
            <div style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.4);letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:4px;">Edits at adoption</div>
          </div>
          <p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.35);line-height:1.6;text-align:center;margin:0;">Board adopted the policy as written on first presentation &mdash; following independent legal review by MSBA counsel.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="padding:44px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:40px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(196,148,42,0.07);">
        <div style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(196,148,42,0.6);letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding-top:4px;">Situation</div>
        <p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.6);line-height:1.82;margin:0;">Strain-Japan R-XVI is a rural K-8 district operating a single school in Franklin County, Missouri. Like most small districts, they had no AI policy and no internal expertise to develop one. Students and staff were already using AI tools &mdash; for writing, for research, for administration &mdash; with no district guidance on what was appropriate, what was prohibited, or what happened when something went wrong. Leadership knew the question was coming from the board. They needed a clear answer.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="padding:44px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:40px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(196,148,42,0.07);">
        <div style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(196,148,42,0.6);letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding-top:4px;">What we delivered</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
          <div><h3 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:500;color:#F4EFE6;margin:0 0 8px;">AI Use Policy</h3><p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.55);line-height:1.8;margin:0;">A complete AI use policy written specifically for Strain-Japan &mdash; their grade range (K-8), their community context, their existing tools. Not adapted from a template. It defines where AI is and isn&rsquo;t appropriate in student work, what staff may use AI for, how new tools are reviewed, and what the incident reporting path looks like. The Safety Huddle is built in.</p></div>
          <div><h3 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:500;color:#F4EFE6;margin:0 0 8px;">AI Use Plan</h3><p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.55);line-height:1.8;margin:0;">A companion planning document that gives leadership a roadmap for implementation: how to introduce the policy to staff, how to communicate it to parents, how to handle the first edge case, and what ongoing review looks like.</p></div>
          <div><h3 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:500;color:#F4EFE6;margin:0 0 8px;">Staff Training</h3><p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.55);line-height:1.8;margin:0;">A 90-minute session that walked staff through the policy, the reasoning behind it, and the practical lines it draws. Designed to give teachers a clear answer to the questions they were already being asked &mdash; by students, by parents, and by themselves.</p></div>
          <div><h3 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:500;color:#F4EFE6;margin:0 0 8px;">Board Presentation and Adoption Package</h3><p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.55);line-height:1.8;margin:0;">A full presentation package for the board: framing the governance context, presenting the policy in accessible terms, and walking the board through the decision they were being asked to make. Developed to be presented by district leadership without requiring Windrose on-site.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="padding:44px 0 52px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:40px;">
        <div style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(196,148,42,0.6);letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding-top:4px;">Outcome</div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:300;color:#C4942A;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;">The board adopted the policy without edits on first presentation.</p>
          <div style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgba(196,148,42,0.7);font-weight:500;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;"><span style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;">&#9670;</span><span>Prior to adoption, the policy was reviewed by legal counsel provided through the Missouri School Boards&rsquo; Association (MSBA). No changes were recommended.</span></div>
          <p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.55);line-height:1.82;margin:0;">Strain-Japan R-XVI now has an AI policy on the books, a staff that knows how to apply it, and a board that made a deliberate, documented decision about AI before something forced the issue. The district went from no policy to full adoption &mdash; with independent legal sign-off &mdash; in a single engagement.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

{/* FUTURE CASE STUDIES — uncomment when a new engagement is ready to publish
  <section style="background:#040B17;padding:64px 52px;border-top:1px solid rgba(196,148,42,0.08);">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:32px;"><div style="width:28px;height:1px;background:rgba(196,148,42,0.3);"></div><span style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;color:rgba(196,148,42,0.4);letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;">Additional case studies added as engagements close</span></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:rgba(196,148,42,0.06);">
      <div style="background:#040B17;padding:52px 32px;border:1px dashed rgba(196,148,42,0.1);text-align:center;"><p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.2);margin:0;">Coming</p></div>
      <div style="background:#040B17;padding:52px 32px;border:1px dashed rgba(196,148,42,0.1);text-align:center;"><p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.2);margin:0;">Coming</p></div>
      <div style="background:#040B17;padding:52px 32px;border:1px dashed rgba(196,148,42,0.1);text-align:center;"><p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgba(244,239,230,0.2);margin:0;">Coming</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
*/}

  <Footer />
</Base>
